  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HHFB845F6A13C048AB10E053139FD9FDD6" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&#xD;
		&lt;div&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="width:36pt; display:inline-block; -aw-tabstop-align:left; -aw-tabstop-pos:36pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;During the three months ended March 31, 2026, pursuant to the Cash Management Agreement among Buckeye Linden Pipe Line Company LLC (the "Company") and its affiliates, the Company effected a settlement of its &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;payables&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; Buckeye Pipe Line Transportation LLC, in the amount &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;1.6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; million&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;, previously&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; included in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;Payables to Affiliated Companies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;through a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;increase&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; of its &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;Additional Paid-in-Capital&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;, effectively representing a non-cash &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;capital contribution from Buckeye Pipe Line Transportation LLC.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
		&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
	&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
